      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Dixon Residential are delighted to present No. 31 Inis Fail, nestled in the heart of Old Bawn - a spacious, well-proportioned three bedroom semi-detached home filled with natural light.\r\n\r\nAs you enter this impressive home, you are greeted by a spacious entrance hall that leads to a bright and inviting living room perfect for relaxing or entertaining. The modern kitchen and dining area, upgraded by the current owners, is located to the rear and offers direct access to the converted garage which is currently being used as a utility room and a separate playroom. The spacious yet low-maintenance rear garden is ideal for outdoor dining and family activities, featuring artificial grass, a granite patio and privacy fencing. Upstairs, the accommodation comprises three well-proportioned bedrooms and a family bathroom.\r\n\r\nThis home is complete with a spacious front garden and private driveway - all ideally positioned within this well established and quiet development.\r\n\r\nOld Bawn is arguably the most highly sought-after area of Dublin 24 and it’s not hard to see why. With its strong community spirit, large green spaces and mature, leafy trees scattered throughout, this established development is ideally located just off the Old Bawn Road, meaning access to the M50 can be reached within a 5 minute drive. There is local schools and shops right on your doorstep, whilst main bus routes are right at the entrance to the estate.\r\n\r\nThis well-presented home combines comfort, convenience, and a family-friendly setting, making it an ideal choice for a wide range of buyers. \r\n\r\nViewing comes highly recommended to appreciate this fine home.\r\n\r\n***Disclaimer:*** *All details are provided to the best of our knowledge. While we strive for accuracy, some information may have been provided by the vendor. We are not liable for any mistakes, errors, or inaccuracies in our online advertising, and we advise all interested parties to seek professional advice regarding any concerns.*"
      },
